## 2. CONTROLLER RULES

```java
// ✅ Template chuẩn
@RestController
@RequestMapping("/api/v1/purchase-requests")
@RequiredArgsConstructor
public class PurchaseRequestController {

    private static final Logger log = LogManager.getLogger(PurchaseRequestController.class);

    // Constructor injection qua @RequiredArgsConstructor — KHÔNG @Autowired
    private final CreatePurchaseRequestUseCase createUseCase;
    private final PrPresentationMapper mapper;

    @PostMapping
    @PreAuthorize("hasAuthority('PR_CREATE')")   // ← Permission code, KHÔNG phải role
    public ResponseEntity<ApiResponse<PurchaseRequestResponse>> create(
            @Valid @RequestBody CreatePrRequest request,
            @AuthenticationPrincipal UserPrincipal principal,
            @RequestHeader("Idempotency-Key") String idempotencyKey) {

        log.info("[CONTROLLER] POST /purchase-requests | userId={}", principal.getMaskedId());
        // Delegate ngay cho UseCase — KHÔNG có business logic ở đây
        var pr = createUseCase.execute(mapper.toCommand(request, principal.getId()), idempotencyKey);
        return ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.CREATED)
                .body(ApiResponse.success("PR_CREATED", mapper.toResponse(pr)));
    }
}
```

### Controller checklist
- [ ] Không có `if/else` nghiệp vụ trong controller
- [ ] Luôn `@Valid` cho `@RequestBody`
- [ ] Log `[CONTROLLER]` khi vào method
- [ ] Dùng `@RequiredArgsConstructor`, KHÔNG `@Autowired`
- [ ] `@PreAuthorize` dùng permission code, KHÔNG hardcode role

