## 5. MYBATIS RULES

```java
// ✅ Simple CRUD: annotation
@Mapper
public interface PurchaseRequestMapper {
    @Insert("INSERT INTO pr.purchase_requests (id, pr_number, ...) VALUES (#{id}, #{prNumber}, ...)")
    void insert(PurchaseRequestEntity entity);

    @Select("SELECT * FROM pr.purchase_requests WHERE id = #{id} AND is_deleted = false")
    @Results(id = "prResult", value = {
        @Result(property = "prNumber", column = "pr_number"),
        @Result(property = "requesterId", column = "requester_id")
    })
    Optional<PurchaseRequestEntity> findById(UUID id);
}
```

```xml
<!-- ✅ Complex query: XML mapper -->
<select id="findByFilter" resultMap="prResult">
  SELECT *, COUNT(*) OVER() AS total_count
  FROM pr.purchase_requests
  WHERE is_deleted = false
  <if test="filter.status != null">AND status = #{filter.status}</if>
  ORDER BY
  <choose>
    <when test="sort.field == 'createdAt'">created_at</when>
    <when test="sort.field == 'totalAmount'">total_amount</when>
    <otherwise>created_at</otherwise>  <!-- Whitelist — KHÔNG inject raw string -->
  </choose>
  <if test="sort.direction == 'asc'">ASC</if><if test="sort.direction != 'asc'">DESC</if>
  LIMIT #{page.size} OFFSET #{page.offset}
</select>
```

### MyBatis checklist
- [ ] Simple CRUD → annotation. Complex / dynamic SQL → XML mapper
- [ ] Luôn dùng `@Results` / `<resultMap>` — KHÔNG auto-mapping
- [ ] ORDER BY PHẢI qua whitelist mapping — không inject raw string từ client
- [ ] `WHERE is_deleted = false` cho mọi SELECT query chính
- [ ] SQL không bao giờ viết trong UseCase hay Controller

