## 6. NAMING CONVENTIONS

```
Java classes:   PascalCase      CreatePurchaseRequestUseCase ✅
Methods/vars:   camelCase       getTotalAmount() ✅
Constants:      UPPER_SNAKE     MAX_RETRY = 3 ✅
Enum values:    UPPER_SNAKE     PrStatus.PENDING_APPROVAL ✅
Packages:       lowercase       com.eprocure.pr ✅

DB tables:      lowercase_snake  purchase_requests ✅
DB columns:     lowercase_snake  pr_number, created_at ✅
DB indexes:     idx_{table}_{cols}  idx_pr_dept_status ✅

API endpoints:  lowercase-hyphen   /purchase-requests ✅
Query params:   snake_case         ?department_id=uuid ✅
JSON fields:    camelCase          { "prNumber": "..." } ✅

Kafka topics:   {domain}.{entity}.{event}  procurement.pr.submitted ✅
Redis keys:     {namespace}:{id}   session:{token}, role-perm:{code} ✅
```

