## 8. TRANSACTION MANAGEMENT

```java
// ✅ @Transactional ở UseCase layer
@Transactional
public PurchaseRequest execute(CreatePrCommand cmd) { ... }

// ✅ readOnly cho query UseCase
@Transactional(readOnly = true)
public Page<PurchaseRequest> findAll(PrFilter f, PageRequest p) { ... }

// ✅ REQUIRES_NEW cho audit log (independent transaction)
@Transactional(propagation = Propagation.REQUIRES_NEW)
public void saveAuditLog(AuditLog log) { ... }

// ❌ KHÔNG @Transactional ở Repository implementation
// ❌ KHÔNG @Transactional ở Controller
```

