## 9. SOFT DELETE (KHÔNG CÓ HTTP DELETE)

```java
// ✅ Soft delete
@PatchMapping("/{id}/cancel")
public ResponseEntity<...> cancel(@PathVariable UUID id) { ... }

// ❌ TUYỆT ĐỐI KHÔNG
@DeleteMapping("/{id}")    // ❌

// ✅ Repository soft delete
void softDelete(UUID id, UUID deletedBy);
// SQL: UPDATE ... SET is_deleted=true, deleted_at=NOW(), deleted_by=:deletedBy WHERE id=:id

// ✅ Mọi SELECT query phải có filter
WHERE is_deleted = false   -- ✅ Luôn luôn
```

